<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>PERSONA — Wear Your Story</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;600&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --ink: #0d0d0d;
      --paper: #f5f0e8;
      --rust: #c0392b;
      --gold: #c9a84c;
      --muted: #7a7165;
      --cream: #faf6ef;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      cursor: none;
    }

    /* Custom cursor */
    .cursor {
      width: 12px; height: 12px;
      background: var(--rust);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9999;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.2s;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }
    .cursor-ring {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1px solid var(--rust);
      border-radius: 50%;
      position: fixed;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 9998;
      transition: transform 0.35s ease, width 0.3s, height 0.3s;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    /* Grain overlay */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 500;
      padding: 24px 48px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 36px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      opacity: 0.6;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { opacity: 1; }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-left {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      padding: 120px 64px 80px 64px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--rust);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.3s forwards;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 9rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.5s forwards;
    }
    .hero-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--rust);
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 32px;
      max-width: 380px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.7s forwards;
    }
    .hero-cta {
      margin-top: 48px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.9s forwards;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
      padding: 16px 40px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--rust); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-ghost {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--muted);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    .hero-right {
      position: relative;
      background: var(--ink);
      overflow: hidden;
      clip-path: polygon(8% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
    }
    .hero-right-inner {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-left: 60px;
    }
    .big-letter {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(18rem, 28vw, 36rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-style: italic;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(245,240,232,0.12);
      line-height: 1;
      user-select: none;
      animation: floatLetter 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 60px;
      right: 60px;
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      background: var(--rust);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      animation: spin 18s linear infinite;
    }
    .hero-badge span {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--paper);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* MARQUEE */
    .marquee-wrap {
      background: var(--rust);
      padding: 14px 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .marquee-track {
      display: inline-flex;
      animation: marquee 18s linear infinite;
    }
    .marquee-track span {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--paper);
      padding: 0 40px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .marquee-track span.dot {
      font-style: normal;
      opacity: 0.5;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }

    /* ABOUT */
    .about {
      padding: 120px 64px;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--rust);
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      transform: rotate(180deg);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .about-content h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .about-content p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 580px;
    }
    .about-stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: 60px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* DROPS / COLLECTION */
    .drops {
      padding: 80px 64px 120px;
      background: var(--ink);
    }
    .drops-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .drops-header h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--paper);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .drops-header h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }
    .drops-header a {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--muted);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .drops-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .drop-card {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #1a1a1a;
      cursor: none;
      group: true;
    }
    .drop-card-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    }
    .drop-card:hover .drop-card-bg { transform: scale(1.06); }
    .drop-tshirt {
      width: 70%;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .drop-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%, transparent 50%);
    }
    .drop-info {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .drop-tag {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .drop-name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--paper);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .drop-price {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.5);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .drop-card-featured {
      grid-row: span 1;
    }

    /* Tshirt SVG illustrations */
    .tshirt-graphic {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
    }

    /* PHILOSOPHY */
    .philosophy {
      padding: 160px 64px;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .philosophy .section-label {
      writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
      transform: none;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .philosophy blockquote {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .philosophy blockquote em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: var(--rust);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rust);
    }
    .philosophy cite {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    /* HOW IT WORKS */
    .how {
      padding: 80px 64px 120px;
      background: #f0ebe0;
    }
    .how-header {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto 80px;
    }
    .how-header h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
    }
    .how-steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .step {
      position: relative;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(13,13,13,0.15);
    }
    .step-num {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--rust);
      opacity: 0.2;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .step-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .step-desc {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* CONTACT / FOOTER */
    footer {
      background: var(--ink);
      padding: 80px 64px 40px;
    }
    .footer-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-bottom: 80px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,240,232,0.1);
    }
    .footer-brand h3 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--paper);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .footer-brand p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 20px;
      max-width: 320px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .footer-links h4 {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .footer-links ul { list-style: none; }
    .footer-links li {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.5);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--paper); }
    .footer-bottom {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-bottom p {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.25);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .footer-bottom a {
      color: rgba(245,240,232,0.25);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-bottom a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    /* ANIMATIONS */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    @keyframes marquee {
      from { transform: translateX(0); }
      to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    }
    @keyframes floatLetter {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(-2deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(-2deg); }
    }
    @keyframes spin {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; }
      .hero-right { display: none; }
      .hero-left { padding: 120px 32px 80px; }
      nav { padding: 20px 32px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 80px 32px; gap: 32px; }
      .section-label { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; transform: none; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .drops { padding: 60px 32px 80px; }
      .drops-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; }
      .drops-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .how { padding: 60px 32px 80px; }
      .how-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .philosophy { padding: 80px 32px; }
      footer { padding: 60px 32px 32px; }
      .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .about-stats { gap: 32px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .drops-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .how-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-title { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>
  <div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <a href="#" class="nav-logo">Persona</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#drops">Drops</a></li>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/perosna-beyourstory" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-left">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">New Drop — SS 2025</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Be Your<br/><em>Story.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Every shirt is a chapter. Every design, a statement. Wear what you are — not what you're told to be.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#drops" class="btn-primary">Shop the Drop</a>
        <a href="#about" class="btn-ghost">Our story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right">
      <div class="hero-right-inner">
        <div class="big-letter">P</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span>LIMITED<br/>DROP<br/>★<br/>PERSONA</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MARQUEE -->
  <div class="marquee-wrap">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <span>Wear Your Story</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Limited Drops</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Crafted With Intent</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Be Your Persona</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Original Designs</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Express Everything</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Wear Your Story</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Limited Drops</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Crafted With Intent</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Be Your Persona</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Original Designs</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
      <span>Express Everything</span><span class="dot">✦</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">About</div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>Clothing that<br/>speaks before<br/>you do.</h2>
      <p>Persona is a curated T-shirt brand built on the belief that what you wear is the first sentence of your story. Each drop is limited, intentional, and designed for people who refuse to blend in.</p>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div>
          <div class="stat-num">12</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Designs this<br/>season</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="stat-num">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Organic<br/>cotton</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="stat-num">∞</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Your story,<br/>your rules</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DROPS -->
  <section class="drops" id="drops">
    <div class="drops-header">
      <h2>Current<br/><em>Drops.</em></h2>
      <a href="https://github.com/perosna-beyourstory" target="_blank">View all on GitHub →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="drops-grid">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="drop-card">
        <div class="drop-card-bg" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);">
          <svg class="tshirt-graphic" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M60 50 L30 70 L50 90 L50 160 L150 160 L150 90 L170 70 L140 50 L120 60 Q100 75 80 60 Z" fill="#0f3460" stroke="rgba(201,168,76,0.4)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="100" y="115" text-anchor="middle" font-family="serif" font-size="14" fill="rgba(201,168,76,0.9)" font-style="italic">MYTH</text>
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="25" stroke="rgba(201,168,76,0.2)" stroke-wid